Dear Hiring Team at {company_name},

I am writing to express my enthusiastic interest in the {job_title} position. With strong expertise in full-stack development (React, Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL) and a proven track record of optimizing backend performance, I am confident in my ability to deliver immediate value to your engineering team.

Key Highlights of My Experience:
- API Performance Optimization: Enhanced backend response times by 30% through caching and query indexing.
- Scalable Full-Stack Engineering: Developed end-to-end web applications with MERN stack and relational databases.
- Financial & Real-Time Dashboards: Built custom data visualization tools integrated with TradingView APIs.

I am particularly impressed by {company_name}'s work and would love the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills can support your product goals.

Best regards,
Nachiket Rana
